#: ../../index.md:3 9081fec840f843dc8a92fd8abbfe4a6d
msgid ""
"A stateful C++ pricing backend driving a TypeScript frontend over "
"WebSocket, with Protobuf as the wire format. A session keeps a live "
"QuantLib object graph alive between requests, so a what-if from the UI "
"moves a quote and recomputes only the instruments that depend on it."
msgstr "一個有狀態的 C++ 定價後端，透過 WebSocket 驅動 TypeScript 前端，並以 Protobuf 作為傳輸格式。工作階段在請求之間維持一個即時的 QuantLib 物件圖，因此從 UI 發出的假設情境會移動一個報價，並只重新計算依賴它的商品。"

#: ../../index.md:8 b7b2b0f2a8634803abc63828dac9d169
msgid ""
"The design, and the QuantLib constraints that force it, are in the "
"[design document](DESIGN.md)."
msgstr "設計，以及迫使它如此設計的 QuantLib 限制，都在[設計文件](DESIGN.md)裡。"

#: ../../index.md:11 d89aa0884be14010a52f31b94d6d1fd5
msgid ""
"**Status.** It runs, and it prices correctly. `ql-backend` serves the "
"protocol over a WebSocket: a session opens, a quote bump reprices off the"
" live graph, one frame sweeps a quote across a spot ladder, Monte Carlo "
"reports progress, and a cancel comes back as `CANCELLED` with the session"
" still alive."
msgstr "**現況。** 它能執行，而且定價正確。`ql-backend` 透過 WebSocket 提供此協定：工作階段開啟、推移一個報價就從即時物件圖重新定價、一個訊框就讓報價掃描過一整排現貨價、蒙地卡羅回報進度，而取消會以 `CANCELLED` 回來，工作階段依然存活。"

#: ../../index.md:16 c62fa98dc50d4582b283ac32e9ac3904
msgid ""
"The wire schema is `v2` (DESIGN §6.3), derived from what QuantLib's own "
"test suite shows a pricing request has to carry: an option is a payoff, "
"an exercise, an underlying and a style, with quanto composing over the "
"styles rather than multiplying them into their own messages. Eight "
"payoffs, three exercises and ten of the schema's twelve styles are built,"
" and they reach 49 distinct compiled engines — analytic, lattice, finite-"
"difference, integral and Monte Carlo, of which 11 are quanto wrappers "
"around another engine on the list. A `Hello` frame answers with the whole"
" of that as data, from `src/session/capabilities.cpp`, so a client never "
"has to send a request to find out what this build prices."
msgstr "傳輸結構描述是 `v2`（DESIGN §6.3），它是從 QuantLib 自己的測試套件所呈現的「定價請求必須攜帶什麼」推導出來的：一個選擇權由收益函數、履約方式、標的與樣式組成，而 quanto 是疊加組合在樣式之上，而不是與它們相乘、各自衍生出獨立的訊息。目前已實作八種收益函數、三種履約方式，以及結構描述十二種樣式中的十種，它們共觸及 49 個不同的已編譯引擎——解析、格點、有限差分、積分與蒙地卡羅，其中 11 個是包在清單上另一個引擎外層的 quanto 包裝。`Hello` 訊框會以資料形式回覆這一整份內容，來源是 `src/session/capabilities.cpp`，因此客戶端永遠不必送出請求，就能知道這個建置能為什麼定價。"

#: ../../index.md:27 65d6776646774ba9aaa006cfe20aa1fb
msgid ""
"`test/smoke_v2.py` prices **369 rows of QuantLib's published reference "
"values** over the wire, each within the tolerance its own test uses. The "
"rows are not transcribed: `test/extract_tables.py` parses them out of "
"`test-suite/*.cpp`. It also cross-checks the analytic quanto barriers "
"against a PDE, which answers the `TODO: bench against an existing prop "
"calculator` that `test-suite/quantooption.cpp` leaves open, and finds one"
" of its three recorded values not reproducible ([the quanto barrier "
"benchmark](BENCHMARK.md)). Builds warning-free under "
"`QLBACKEND_WERROR=ON` on both routes — the vendored QuantLib v1.43 and a "
"1.44-dev install — with AppleClang 21 at C++17, schema clean under "
"`protoc 34.0`."
msgstr "`test/smoke_v2.py` 透過傳輸線路為 **369 列 QuantLib 公開的參考值**定價，每一列都落在它原本的測試所用的容差之內。這些列不是手抄的：`test/extract_tables.py` 從 `test-suite/*.cpp` 把它們解析出來。它也以 PDE 交叉驗證解析式的 quanto 障礙選擇權，這回應了 `test-suite/quantooption.cpp` 懸而未決的 `TODO: bench against an existing prop calculator`，並發現它記錄的三個值中有一個無法重現（[quanto 障礙選擇權基準測試](BENCHMARK.md)）。在兩條路線上——內附的 QuantLib v1.43 與一份 1.44-dev 安裝——以 AppleClang 21、C++17，在 `QLBACKEND_WERROR=ON` 下建置皆無警告，結構描述在 `protoc 34.0` 下也乾淨無誤。"

#: ../../index.md:38 1f483974d7b64a328fee20769b50baf5
msgid ""
"A session now outlives its socket by a minute, and so does the work in "
"it: a client that loses its connection takes the session back with "
"`ResumeSession` and the token it was given, and the Monte Carlo that was "
"running is still running (DESIGN §9.4). The bootstrap was never what a "
"dropped socket cost."
msgstr "工作階段現在會比它的連線多存活一分鐘，其中的工作也是：失去連線的客戶端以 `ResumeSession` 與先前拿到的權杖接回工作階段，而原本在跑的蒙地卡羅仍在繼續跑（DESIGN §9.4）。連線中斷的代價從來就不是建構。"

#: ../../index.md:43 5049f9a00fee4ca3b864d8f0204c6a1f
msgid ""
"What is missing is the process boundary. Workers are threads in the "
"gateway process for now, so a cancel that has to kill cannot (DESIGN §3),"
" and replay-after-death is never exercised."
msgstr "欠缺的是行程邊界。目前工作者是閘道行程中的執行緒，所以必須靠 kill 才能完成的取消做不到（DESIGN §3），而行程死亡後的重播也從未真正執行過。"

#: ../../index.md:55 460bcec1b95d4801bb4c7fd8909617bf
msgid ""
"The port is 9111 by convention rather than by default — every script and "
"test in both repositories passes `--port 9111`, and the built-in default "
"is 9001. A browser is let in from the Vite dev server's ports only; "
"anything else needs `--allow-origin URL` (DESIGN §9.6), and `--help` "
"lists that flag, the two caps, and `--any-origin` for a deployment behind"
" a proxy that already checks."
msgstr "連接埠 9111 是慣例而非預設——兩個儲存庫中的每一支腳本與測試都傳入 `--port 9111`，而內建預設值是 9001。瀏覽器只有來自 Vite 開發伺服器的連接埠才會被放行；其他來源都需要 `--allow-origin URL`（DESIGN §9.6），而 `--help` 會列出這個旗標、兩項上限，以及供部署在已會檢查的代理之後使用的 `--any-origin`。"

#: ../../index.md:61 ea16b9a5fdf24f0783d615c8333b7821
msgid ""
"On a machine with other users on it, add `--token-file FILE`: the origin "
"check closes the browser, and the token is what closes their processes, "
"which no proxy can do from in front of a loopback socket. It is read from"
" the file, or minted into it at `0600` on first use, and every client "
"presents it at the upgrade or is answered `401`. A `--host` that is not "
"loopback is refused without one, because a pricing engine with no "
"authentication answering the network is an accident rather than a "
"decision."
msgstr "在有其他使用者的機器上，加上 `--token-file FILE`：Origin 檢查擋住的是瀏覽器，而權杖擋住的是他們的行程——這是任何擋在迴路位址連線前面的代理都做不到的。權杖從該檔案讀取，或在第一次使用時以 `0600` 權限產生並寫入，每個客戶端都要在升級時出示它，否則會得到 `401`。沒有權杖時，非迴路位址的 `--host` 會被拒絕，因為一個沒有驗證卻對網路應答的定價引擎是意外，而不是決定。"

#: ../../index.md:69 f8235dff83c34bed9a53b7bb46baf9a0
msgid ""
"That builds QuantLib from the submodule, which is the route that works "
"unmodified from a clean clone: `CMakeLists.txt` forces "
"`QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS=ON`, without which two sessions in one process "
"silently share one `Settings::evaluationDate()` (DESIGN §2). Linking an "
"installed QuantLib instead is the default and is much faster to rebuild, "
"but it can only be got right by hand."
msgstr "這會從子模組建置 QuantLib，這是從乾淨的 clone 不必修改就能運作的路線：`CMakeLists.txt` 強制設定 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS=ON`，少了它，同一個行程中的兩個工作階段會悄悄共用同一個 `Settings::evaluationDate()`（DESIGN §2）。改為連結已安裝的 QuantLib 才是預設做法，重新建置也快得多，但只能靠手動把它弄對。"

#: ../../index.md:76 e5aeb053e76042f6a1cbc50a7178418e
msgid ""
"[The build page](INSTALL.md) has both routes, the prerequisites, how to "
"build a sessions-enabled QuantLib into a prefix of its own, and the "
"failures that are silent rather than loud."
msgstr "[建置頁面](INSTALL.md)涵蓋兩條路線、先決條件、如何把啟用工作階段的 QuantLib 建置到專屬的前綴，以及那些靜悄悄而非大張旗鼓的失敗。"

#: ../../index.md:80 1daf17ef8db2408bb500c143eabbb60d
msgid ""
"Compiling it was worth doing. Four things in this code were wrong in ways"
" no amount of re-reading would have shown: `namespace pb` collides with "
"protobuf's own alias in `extension_set.h`, `RateHelper` is a typedef and "
"cannot be forward declared, `ql/indexes/ibor/overnightindex.hpp` does not"
" exist (`OvernightIndex` lives in `iborindex.hpp`), and `std::min` cannot"
" deduce between `Size` and the `uint64` a proto field returns."
msgstr "實際編譯它是值得的。這份程式碼中有四處錯誤，再怎麼重讀也看不出來：`namespace pb` 與 protobuf 在 `extension_set.h` 中自己的別名衝突、`RateHelper` 是 typedef 而無法前向宣告、`ql/indexes/ibor/overnightindex.hpp` 並不存在（`OvernightIndex` 位於 `iborindex.hpp`），以及 `std::min` 無法在 `Size` 與 proto 欄位回傳的 `uint64` 之間推導型別。"

